# The keys whose signature a Loam release must carry (docs/signing.md).
#
# OpenSSH's allowed_signers format, one key a line:
#   loam-release namespaces="git" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... a comment
#
# An install checks a newer release against this file as it is in the
# release it already runs, so a key added here is trusted from the release
# after the one that adds it. While this file holds no key line, releases
# are not checked, and the updater says so. install.sh carries a copy of the
# key lines between its RELEASE-SIGNERS markers; tests/test_signing.py keeps
# the two equal.
